1
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,240
I didn't expect

2
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,840
things to turn out like this.

3
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:06,640
But it has already happened,

4
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:07,960
and there's no way to change it.

5
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:08,520
So...

6
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:10,380
You're hiding something from me.

7
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:11,500
I...

8
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:13,039
What am I hiding from you?

9
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:18,280
When we first met,

10
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,920
you pretended you didn't know how to use a gun,

11
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:21,580
but you shoot better than I do.

12
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:22,440
I...

13
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:24,360
I did lie to you.

14
00:01:24,520 --> 00:01:26,440
I grew up in the army with my father,

15
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:28,080
so I'm very good with a gun.

16
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:30,720
I knew you weren't a bandit.

17
00:01:31,160 --> 00:01:32,680
But I had my reasons.

18
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,810
You don't need to explain so much to me.

19
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:39,440
But I can feel your sincerity.

20
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:12,680
Are you feeling better?

21
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:14,840
Senior Sister.

22
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,079
Gordon's tattoo

23
00:02:16,079 --> 00:02:17,740
doesn't have a bident either.

24
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:18,680
Henry doesn't have it either.

25
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,880
Neither does Wallace.

26
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:20,880
How could this be?

27
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:22,040
Then who

28
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:23,120
could it be?

29
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:25,040
We are not far from the truth.

30
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:37,920
That wasn't your fault.

31
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:45,640
Since they call themselves the Satanic Society,

32
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:48,040
they must be the opposite of Christianity.

33
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:51,140
Thirteen demons correspond to thirteen apostles.

34
00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:59,920
Could there be a thirteenth person?

35
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:04,160
I know who the thirteenth person is.

36
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,120
Back then, this Thomas

37
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,520
sold all his cars in the UK

38
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:21,500
to come to China and open a school.

39
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,040
I suspected everyone,

40
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:24,680
except him.

41
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:28,700
Bai Xianming used to be the church's general affairs manager.

42
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,520
How interesting.

43
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:33,180
This place doesn't look like anyone lived here.

44
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:36,280
What are you doing?

45
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:37,480
What are you doing at my house?

46
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,140
Your house?

47
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,640
Wasn't this originally a school?

48
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:41,840
So you know it used to be.

49
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:42,320
Sir.

50
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:43,520
What kind of weapon

51
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,650
is that in your hand?

52
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:45,760
Scared?

53
00:03:46,079 --> 00:03:48,480
This is a weapon used by the foreign church.

54
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:55,440
Sir.

55
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,440
Can you sell this thing to us?

56
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:10,160
How did my father die?

57
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:12,640
He was killed by the police from the Fenghuang Police Station.

58
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:13,440
Who?

59
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,840
Jiang Siyao.

60
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:30,300
Is this Bai Xianming's house?

61
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:33,880
Who are you?

62
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,040
Police.

63
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:37,080
We want to ask you some questions.

64
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:39,640
Bai Xianming used to work at the missionary girls' school

65
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:41,120
as a general affairs manager, right?

66
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,440
That bastard.

67
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,159
After he came back from studying abroad,

68
00:04:44,159 --> 00:04:46,680
he stayed at that lousy missionary girls' school.

69
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,560
He rarely came here.

70
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,880
I don't know anything.

71
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,040
Where is his room?

72
00:04:50,159 --> 00:04:51,120
Can I take a look?

73
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,080
He doesn't have a room here.

74
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:55,280
Did he leave anything behind?

75
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:56,320
Nothing at all.

76
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,770
Sorry to bother you.

77
00:04:58,920 --> 00:04:59,720
Wait a minute.

78
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:11,240
Everything he had is here.

79
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:12,500
See if it's useful.

80
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:16,040
Where are they?

81
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:16,480
Sir.

82
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,840
They are hiding in an abandoned house.

83
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:19,880
Lin Jinwen is not dead.

84
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:21,480
He was pretending to be the Master.

85
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:23,560
Lei Lie really didn't do a good job.

86
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,240
Sir.

87
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:25,640
Should we

88
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:26,920
make a move now?

89
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:28,120
Hold on a little longer.

90
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,720
Someone hasn't shown up yet.

91
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:32,240
Where is Huo Yining?

92
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,520
He was rescued by Lin Jinwen, who faked his death.

93
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:36,760
They are hiding in the countryside.

94
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:37,880
Is she hurt?

95
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,120
She is fine.

96
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,760
As for the people traveling with her,

97
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:42,620
I heard some of them were injured.

98
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:44,770
Keep a close eye on them.

99
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:46,840
Report to me at any time.

100
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:47,760
Sir.

101
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:49,520
I heard Mayor Zeng,

102
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:51,680
Superintendent Li, and the police station

103
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:53,080
are all looking for them.

104
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:55,370
If they run into each other,

105
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:01,160
let's wait and see.

106
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,840
If something goes wrong...

107
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:05,960
If necessary,

108
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:07,880
only protect Huo Yining.

109
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:09,250
There is someone

110
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:11,640
who has been lying to me for a long time.

111
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:14,440
He kept deceiving me under the guise of doing it for my own good.

112
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:15,200
I just

113
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:16,840
can't get over it.

114
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,120
Give it to me.

115
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:25,640
Is he a bad person?

116
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,000
I don't know.

117
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,720
I'm even

118
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,159
still doubting him.

119
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:39,000
Ancestors of the Huo family.

120
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,640
I, Huo Qishan,

121
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:42,280
am unfilial.

122
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:45,360
Ningning has had a weak destiny since birth.

123
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:46,960
I had no choice

124
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:49,840
but to put the destiny of my great-grandfather's daughter

125
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,480
onto Ningning.

126
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:54,200
May our ancestors

127
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:57,159
bless Ningning with good health

128
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,840
and safety.

129
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:08,120
She is my only child.

130
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:14,080
You mean someone who treats you very well,

131
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:16,440
but you still suspect him?

132
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:23,360
Actually, I can understand.

133
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:25,480
Because sometimes,

134
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,640
it's really hard to simply use good or evil

135
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:28,700
to define a person.

136
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:32,560
He might do a lot of evil to the world,

137
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:35,700
but he might also love you deeply.

138
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:39,120
Your previous

139
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:41,960
brainless and fearless silliness was quite good.

140
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:42,960
Thinking too much

141
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:44,720
really doesn't suit you.

142
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,320
Is she praising me

143
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:49,980
or scolding me?

144
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:52,680
Young Master,

145
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:57,120
this is what you asked me to find in your letter.

146
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:00,560
Okay, you may go.

147
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:01,200
Yes.

148
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:10,480
Sir.

149
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:13,360
The higher-ups are pressuring us to kill them all,

150
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,560
leaving no one alive.

151
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,600
I feel like

152
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:17,680
there's another force protecting them in the dark.

153
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:19,320
Let me guess.

154
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:20,480
It's Xinfeng Stronghold.

155
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:22,040
How did you guess that, sir?

156
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,220
What was buried five years ago

157
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:26,080
wasn't just the Skeleton Case in the Capital Suburbs.

158
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:26,720
Then let's

159
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:28,320
wait a bit longer.

160
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:29,720
The fish aren't in a hurry,

161
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:31,250
so why should the angler be?

162
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:32,640
These

163
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,240
are the records of purchasing teaching equipment

164
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:36,440
and other daily expenses of the school.

165
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,059
There's no problem at all.

166
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:43,610
Strange.

167
00:08:43,679 --> 00:08:45,160
Why would the school buy

168
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:46,160
so many goats?

169
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:48,760
It's definitely not for the mutton.

170
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,640
Goats.

171
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:53,240
What exactly does this mean?

172
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:53,960
It should be

173
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:55,240
a code.

174
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:58,440
All of Thomas's identities

175
00:08:58,440 --> 00:09:00,440
in China are fake.

176
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:02,040
He didn't actually sell his assets

177
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:03,970
to come to China and start a school.

178
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:06,120
Then if we have any evidence,

179
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:07,960
he can change his identity at any time to escape punishment.

180
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,720
Then what is his real identity?

181
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,480
Five years ago,

182
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:17,140
Li Chengrui found Li Youcai one step ahead of us.

183
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:20,360
After Senior Song found the Seven-Colored Banded Krait Diagram,

184
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:22,440
all clues abruptly stopped.

185
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,760
And now we can actually find it.

186
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,280
No.

187
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,360
What's wrong?

188
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:30,160
Li Chengrui left the police station for a while,

189
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:32,620
right after the Wei Xiaodong case happened.

190
00:09:32,760 --> 00:09:34,400
Then he suddenly transformed

191
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:35,730
into a superintendent.

192
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,560
Isn't this too much of a coincidence?

193
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:39,760
I remember back then,

194
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,760
Chief Huang publicly claimed

195
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:42,960
that he went to study.

196
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,120
I heard Huo Qishan

197
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,480
talk about this.

198
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:49,040
Speaking of Li Chengrui,

199
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,680
many years ago,

200
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:52,200
his reputation

201
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:54,360
was no worse than Jiang Siyao's.

202
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:55,440
I remember

203
00:09:55,760 --> 00:09:58,720
there was a case of a wrongfully killed fisherman back then.

204
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,920
For that case,

205
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,700
he offended Marshal Duan.

206
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:02,680
He took off his police uniform

207
00:10:02,680 --> 00:10:04,610
and stayed in there for over a year.

208
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:06,280
Tell me, how could a policeman like him

209
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:07,920
be involved in this?

210
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:08,880
Marshal Duan.

211
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:12,760
When I first joined the police station,

212
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:14,480
Li Chengrui somehow

213
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,920
offended that Marshal Duan.

214
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:17,040
Then he was beaten up

215
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:18,320
and finally locked up.

216
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:20,680
After he came out, he became a superintendent.

217
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:22,760
At the time, everyone thought it was a false rumor.

218
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:25,560
Marshal Duan was once a warlord who ruled a region.

219
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:28,560
Phoenix City was part of Marshal Duan's territory.

220
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:30,360
But later, for some unknown reason,

221
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,360
it was separated.

222
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:34,770
Ever since Zeng Guoquan became the mayor,

223
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:37,610
Commander Duan has disappeared without a trace.

224
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:38,640
What do you think?

225
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:41,240
Do you think there's a connection?

226
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,240
I need to go out.

227
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,120
What for?

228
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,240
None of your business.

229
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:47,360
Do you know it's dangerous at this time?

230
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,280
If you're going out, I'll go with you.

231
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:48,880
I'll go with her.

232
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:49,880
I can protect you.

233
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,810
Neither of you is allowed to go.

234
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:05,280
Who?
